Rude.
-That's nice.

00:09:59.531 --> 00:10:01.734
-No.
-Here's another one that says,

00:10:01.734 --> 00:10:04.036
"I'd do anything for you, Dad."
-Aww.

00:10:04.036 --> 00:10:06.338
-"Except try to explain the
Marvel Cinematic Universe."

00:10:06.338 --> 00:10:08.507
[ Laughter ]
It's too complicated.

00:10:08.507 --> 00:10:11.042
[ Applause ]

00:10:11.042 --> 00:10:13.011
Next card says,
"Thanks for doing so much work

00:10:13.011 --> 00:10:14.380
around the house...

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:15.914
before we eventually
call a handyman

00:10:15.914 --> 00:10:21.020
to fix everything you did."
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:21.020 --> 00:10:22.287
Caulk, caulk.
-Caulk gun.

00:10:22.287 --> 00:10:24.222
Caulk.
-My dad, that was his solution.

00:10:24.222 --> 00:10:26.959
-He would caulk everything.
-He caulked everything.

00:10:26.959 --> 00:10:29.395
Every -- the whole house was
made out of caulk at one point.

00:10:29.395 --> 00:10:31.697
-Really? He made like a caulk
igloo, and stuff like that?

00:10:31.697 --> 00:10:32.898
-Yeah, it was like -- yeah.
It was like --

00:10:32.898 --> 00:10:35.234
Yeah, it looked like a --
Yeah, of caulk.

00:10:35.234 --> 00:10:36.702
[ Laughter ]

00:10:36.702 --> 00:10:38.136
It looked like a --
like a gingerbread house.

00:10:38.136 --> 00:10:39.839
-Oh, wow.
-Like icing.

00:10:39.839 --> 00:10:41.006
-Yeah, icing everywhere.
-Dripping down, yeah.

00:10:41.006 --> 00:10:43.809
Except it was all caulk, yeah.

00:10:43.809 --> 00:10:47.212
This next card says,
"I'm your son."

00:10:47.212 --> 00:10:49.014
Inside it says,
"No matter how many DNA tests

00:10:49.014 --> 00:10:50.516
you've made me take
to prove otherwise."

00:10:50.516 --> 00:10:51.784
[ Cheers and applause ]
That's harsh.

00:10:51.784 --> 00:10:53.752
That's a little rude.
-That's rude. That's mean.

00:10:53.752 --> 00:10:57.089
-Then, finally, this card says,
"Dad, I can't wait."

00:10:57.089 --> 00:10:58.990
Open it up, it says,
"To find this card in a box

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:00.726
in 30 years as proof
that you really did care."

00:11:00.726 --> 00:11:01.860
[ Audience "Awws" ]

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.562
Those are some nice cards.
I love you, Dad!

